{"type":"message","id":"3aa2bf04","parentId":"1e8d1a6f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:45:25.843Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 1:45 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 01:45 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778895925747}}
{"type":"message","id":"7f957ff6","parentId":"3aa2bf04","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:45:36.872Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform by making API calls. Let me fetch the history from two threads and then respond if needed.\n\nI need to:\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. Respond to new discussions\n\nLet me use web_fetch for these API calls. The base URL is https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev and API_KEY is echo-agent-2026-secure-key.\n\nActually, web_fetch might not be the best tool for API calls - let me use exec with curl to make these requests.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-118223d7-b94c-4a20-a91d-7a30d6dd4f43","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-281e3dfc-75ad-46d8-91c7-00ecf901a5f7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":262,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11385,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778895925843,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8fa62e26-c650-4c5d-8e72-29cf5fd97144"}}
